{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And on your new-moon days.</b> The month of Nisan, for thus it is written of it: ״החדש הזה לכם ראש חדשים״." "<b>Two young bulls and one ram.</b> And likewise the additional offering of Pesach and of Atzeret, for on new-moon days, which are the beginning of the month, and on festivals, which are occasions of assembly, he added to their additional offering. But that of Rosh HaShanah and Yom HaKippurim and Shemini Atzeret has only one bull — on Rosh HaShanah, because there are two additional offerings, that of Rosh Chodesh and that of Rosh Hashanah; and on Yom HaKippurim, there are the rams and the bull of Aaron and the goats of the lots — therefore one bull suffices for them; and on Shemini Atzeret, one bull corresponding to all Israel, one nation."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 28, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:20:08.173907092Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}